part LDO-3V3 {
    @~footprint    = SOT-23-5;
    #value         = AP2112K-3.3;
    @!type         = regulator;
    #~mpn          = "AP2112K-3.3TRG1";
    #!manufacturer = "Diodes Incorporated";

    1 : VIN<  &TYPE=POWER;
    2 : GND<  &TYPE=POWER;
    3 : EN<   #VIH=1V4 #VIL=0V4;
    4 : NC    &TYPE=NC;
    5 : VOUT> &TYPE=POWER #SUPPLY=600mA;
};

---

# AP2112K-3.3

**Source:** Diodes Incorporated, AP2112 datasheet, document DS31563.
SOT-25 (SOT-23-5) package, fixed 3.3 V output, 600 mA CMOS LDO with enable.

## Pins

| Pin | Name | Function |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | VIN | Input supply |
| 2 | GND | Ground |
| 3 | EN | Enable, active high. Do not leave floating |
| 4 | NC | No connection |
| 5 | VOUT | Regulated output |

## Absolute maximum ratings

| Parameter | Value |
|---|---|
| VIN | −0.3 to 7 V |
| EN | −0.3 to VIN + 0.3 V |
| Output current | internally limited |
| Junction temperature | 150 °C |
| Storage temperature | −65 to +150 °C |

## Recommended operating conditions

| Parameter | Min | Max |
|---|---|---|
| Input voltage | 2.5 V | 6 V |
| Ambient temperature | −40 °C | +85 °C |

## Electrical characteristics (TA = 25 °C, VIN = VOUT + 1 V, unless noted)

| Parameter | Condition | Min | Typ | Max | Unit |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Output voltage accuracy | IOUT = 1 mA | −1.5 | | +1.5 | % |
| Output current | | 600 | | | mA |
| Dropout voltage | IOUT = 600 mA | | 250 | | mV |
| Quiescent current | IOUT = 0, EN high | | 55 | | µA |
| Shutdown current | EN low | | 0.01 | 1 | µA |
| EN input high | | 1.4 | | | V |
| EN input low | | | | 0.4 | V |

## Application

Stable with a 1 µF ceramic capacitor on the output; the datasheet's typical
application uses 1 µF at VIN and 1 µF at VOUT, placed close to the pins. EN
may be tied to VIN for always-on operation.

## Package

SOT-25, 2.9 × 1.6 mm body, 0.95 mm pitch. Pin 1 is at the marked corner;
pins 1–3 on one side, 4–5 on the other.
